# Zipper split batch 9 (2026-10-05, session genealogy-fa): the Hordaland chain, splits #385, 540, 542, 810, 811, 1101, 1171 in the verdict files.
# Geni puts Bifra-Kåre Aunarsson between Aslak and Aun, and the zipper's anchor was a son of Horda-Kåre, so every NN wife/mother we created sat one or two generations too high. Each is moved to her own husband and son (by her Geni record). Wikidata's own P22/P40 chain is not touched.
# Aslak Bifrakari Q19949677 = Geni's Aslak Kåresson (father of Horda-Kåre); his father is disputed: Aun (Wikidata) or Bifra-Kåre (Geni, created). Our Kaun Sølvesson Q141635383 duplicates Kaun Q19950168 (merge list); his wrong child Solgi comes off. Run with Run, never in background.
